    : 0;
Q.razem_leader = "Adrian Zandberg";
Q.razem_co_leader = "Vacant";
Q.razem_leadership_result =
    "Zandberg chairs independent Razem after the cooperative group is absorbed";
Q.biejat_party = leftOrganisation;
Q.gosek_popiolek_party = leftOrganisation;
Q.olko_party = leftOrganisation;
Q.wicha_party = leftOrganisation;
Q.stozek_party = leftOrganisation;
Q.wspolne_jutro_formed = 0;
Q.wspolne_jutro_outcome =
    "The cooperative group was absorbed before Wspólne Jutro could form";
Q.razem_biejat_relation = 12;
Q.party_unity -= 5;
Q.razem_cooperation = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.razem_cooperation) || 0) - 16
);
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.barons_dissent -= 2;
Q.spring_dissent += 3;
Q.labor_dissent += 1;
Q.pps_dissent += 5;
Q.left_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) - oppositionSeats);
Q.razem_party_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.razem_party_seats) || 0) + oppositionSeats;
Q.nowa_lewica_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.nowa_lewica_seats) || 0) + cooperativeSejmSeats;
Q.left_progressives_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_progressives_seats) || 0) +
    cooperativeSejmSeats;
Q.left_new_generation_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_labor_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_progressives_seats) || 0);
Q.razem_seats = 0;
Q.zandberg_advisor = 0;
Q.zawisza_advisor = 0;
Q.matysiak_advisor = 0;
Q.seat_subvention_seats = Q.left_seats;
Q.news_headline = Q.left_in_government
    ? "The governing left absorbs Razem's cooperative current and creates a separate rival"
    : "New Left absorbs Razem's cooperative current and creates a rival on its own flank";
!}

Biejat and the cooperative deputies enter New Left rather than form a bridge
between two organisations. The larger caucus gives us recognisable younger
faces and a cleaner media line. Zandberg leaves with a smaller party, a sharper
grievance and an easy accusation: a dispute over what the Left achieved has
ended as a raid on his membership.

Our former Razem advisers depart with him. The split is administratively neat
and politically hostile; every future appeal for a common list will begin with
the memory of this absorption.

The SLD barons approve the cleaner chain of command. Wiosna veterans dislike
turning a strategic dispute into a membership raid; labour keeps the four MPs'
social work, while progressive organisers resent inheriting them without an
autonomous settlement. PPS reads the absorption as a warning about its own
future inside a larger party.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the membership cards on the events desk

@sovereign_merger_2024
# prose-audit: Grade A — The merger is told as a post-defeat bargain among named factions, and each Lewica response produces a distinct public interpretation rather than a numerical ledger.
title: PiS absorbs Suwerenna Polska
subtitle: Ziobro's hard-right partner becomes a faction inside Kaczyński's party
