Lewica leaves the rival biographies to PiS and puts hospital queues, public
pay and household costs beside the merged party's record in office. The
contrast gives workers a reason to care about the reorganisation. [? if
left_in_government = 0: It does not itself shorten a queue or raise a wage:
this is an opposition programme, not an enacted service reform.?] [? if
left_in_government = 1 and government_party != "pis": Governing authority lets
us turn that contrast into a proposal, but nothing changes in a ward or pay
packet until the cabinet passes and funds it.?] [? if left_in_government = 1
and government_party = "pis": Inside a PiS-led cabinet, this is a challenge to
our own coalition partners rather than an opposition attack. Until our
ministers win funding, it remains a declaration against the record of the
government we chose to join.?] Jaki is free to consolidate the nationalist
audience we have chosen not to contest on his terms.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the public-service contrast on the events desk
